      "message": "fix(2d): Face says it has no pass order on the Pass starts at row\n\nFace cuts serpentine rows from one edge of the face to the other, so it\nhas no inside or outside pass order. The Face Passes tab now shows the\nshared \"Pass starts at\" row, held at Auto and disabled, with the reason\nin view. MCP edit_operation refuses pass_start on a Face with that\nreason, not with the generic \"unknown field\". Face output and the\nproject file do not change.\n\nFixes #3356\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
